{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NO LOGIC INC.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>The vending machine spits bricks.<br>The meat whispers.<br>The bench is watching.</strong><br>And you still think this is normal?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/\u043a\u0438\u0440\u043f\u0438\u0447.gif?t=1747694610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">You\u2019re an agent of the Bureau of Absurd Control.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Your mission: bring order to a world that has clearly decided</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>logic is obsolete.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Welcome to a place where:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\uddf1 Vending machines launch bricks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83c\udf56 Meat says things you\u2019d rather not hear.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\ude91 Benches take flight the moment you blink.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>NO LOGIC INC.</strong> is an absurd simulator of anomaly hunting \u2014<br>where you\u2019re not really fighting monsters,<br><strong>you\u2019re fighting the slow collapse of what you once called &quot;normal.&quot;</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83d\udc80 <strong>Objective:</strong> Hunt and neutralize anomalies before they destroy the park \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">and <strong>your sanity along with it.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3710990/extras/\u043c\u044f\u0441\u043b.gif?t=1747694610\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\ud83e\udd21 It\u2019s short, strange, and painfully familiar in all the wrong ways.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">If you\u2019ve ever argued with a microwave \u2014</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>this is where you belong.</strong></p><p 